{
  "consts": ["i"],
  "title": { "zh": "写量词" },
  "intro": [{ "t": { "zh": "安这样表示东西的名字，也在下面的块里。" } }],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "t-wquant_1",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第一题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "∀x. Human(x) → Mortal(x)", "q": "Human(i)" },
      "goal": "Mortal(i)",
      "answer": "p i q",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:allE\"></part-ref>写成应用，参数是那样东西：p 用在安上，再用在 q 上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-wquant_2",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第二题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": {},
      "goal": "∀x. Human(x) → Human(x)",
      "answer": "fun a b => b",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:allI\"></part-ref>也是 fun，拿到的 a 是一样东西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-wquant_3",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第三题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "Human(i)" },
      "goal": "∃x. Human(x)",
      "answer": "⟨i, p⟩",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:exI\"></part-ref>写成一对：左边是例子，右边是它满足的证明。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-wquant_4",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第四题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "∃x. Human(x) ∧ Mortal(x)" },
      "goal": "∃x. Mortal(x)",
      "answer": "p.elim (fun a b => ⟨a, b.2⟩)",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:exE\"></part-ref>写成「□.elim (fun _ _ => □)」：a 是那样东西，b 是它满足的那句。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
